# The one version every package in this repository carries: the npm packages
# under packages/, runtime/schema/typescript and runtime/http/typescript, the
# PyPI distribution under runtime/schema/python, the crate under
# runtime/http/rust, and the inter-module requires in the Go go.mod files (the
# Go modules themselves are versioned by tags: vX.Y.Z, ir/vX.Y.Z,
# runtime/schema/go/vX.Y.Z, runtime/http/go/vX.Y.Z).
#
# scripts/bump_version.py is the only thing that writes this file and the
# sites it lists; `bump_version.py check` fails when any site disagrees with
# it. 0.0.0 means unreleased. See CONTRIBUTING.md, "Releases".
VERSION=0.0.0
